{"id":"626644","name":"酱香芝麻烧饼","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/626644/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"370克"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"3克"}],"sub":[{"name":"温水","amount":"200克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"玉米油","amount":"15克"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面包机桶里依次放入清水、鸡蛋、玉米油，盐、面粉、酵母，开始和面。","img":"images/626644/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"和成面团留在桶里继续发酵。","img":"images/626644/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"发酵后移至面板揉匀排气。","img":"images/626644/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"擀成大薄片。","img":"images/626644/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"均匀刷上豆瓣酱和芝麻酱。","img":"images/626644/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"卷起来。","img":"images/626644/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"分成小剂子。","img":"images/626644/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"捏住两端，封口朝下。","img":"images/626644/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"表面喷水，蘸上芝麻。","img":"images/626644/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"依次完成，码放烤盘上。","img":"images/626644/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入烤箱，180度预热五分钟，上下火烤25分钟。","img":"images/626644/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"趁热食用。","img":"images/626644/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"按自己家的烤箱性能调整温度，烤制时底部放一小碗开水。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}